ent and non-minimal lengths. These leave attacker-controlled bytes inside an accepted DigestInfo, which allows signatures to be forged without the private </description></item><item><title>GHSA-2h4w-29cv-2cmv / CVE-2026-113663: AG2: Newline injection in SandboxShellTool bypasses allowed=[...] and readonly=True, enabling arbitrary command execution (ag2, autogen, high)</title><link>https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-2h4w-29cv-2cmv</link><guid isPermaLink="false">0b2499db6ec0</guid><pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 15:57:17 -0000</pubDate><category>untagged</category><description>GitHub Advisory Database: ### Summary SandboxShellTool's restricted modes — allowed=[...] (explicit command allowlist) and readonly=True (implicit READONLY_COMMANDS allowlist) — can both be bypassed by embedding a newline character inside the command string. The filter only inspects a single-line set of shell metacharacters, but execution runs the raw string through `sh -c`, where a shell treats an embedded newline exactly</description></item><item><title>La pregunta del billón: ¿Visión o vulnerabilidad en la inversión en IA?</title><link>https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiogFBVV95cUxQWWxjT2g4NlF3ZGJXLVBmdWR6YXhtSVpaRkdGaUJuMENTOElSQWotN0tVMC02ckd4STlIeTU4OWhSU3lEa1NxdXowZmliVkwxMGpsTjhrNEJ4YzFlUzlqemoyU0NjcFpSVEo1SlpaOHJGTWxYYWlTVFB6UGtERVRHUTdUMFBDSGVIdFBSa2h0ckJZbmI4dzBCOG9ZQl9GV2dLQXc?oc=5</link><guid isPermaLink="false">a491b5591865</guid><pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 15:53:14 -0000</pubDate><category>untagged</category><description>Periódico elDinero: </description></item><item><title>Australia to launch AI safety regulator after OpenAI breach</title><link>https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihwFBVV95cUxQZFZ0aS1BYmtrMzNUUF9LOGtCVXBOV2dfTzlCbC1fT0pZRk8tTWR2a09vTFpLTDUtU2JyVWZmaDRDUnZ6empQZTg1Z0hjTEtfWEpkYmJINzh1TmVOaXg5UEF4RXVjR2xraU1VWGFuWVdhT3ZRYVhDbzIxczBCbXFkQ0IwaVBhcUk?oc=5</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1c0aa4de30c2</guid><pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 15:45:05 -0000</pubDate><category>u